      "summary": "<p>11<span>月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">17</span><span>日，上交所并购重组委召开会议，审议通过东吴证券发行股份及支付现金购买东海证券</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">83.68%</span><span>股份的申请。从</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">3</span><span>月</span><span style=\"font-family: Times New Roman;\">13</span><span>日董事会抛出预案到今天的过会，这笔交易前后走了八个多月。</span></p>\n<p><span>这是</span><strong><span>江苏首次</span></strong><span>同省跨地级市国资券商整合，也是</span><strong><span>全国首例</span></strong><span>同省不同地级市券商并购案</s",
